{"id":1585,"date":"2023-02-21T05:29:47","date_gmt":"2023-02-21T12:29:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/citruscapital.ca\/?page_id=1585"},"modified":"2026-06-22T18:01:41","modified_gmt":"2026-06-23T00:01:41","slug":"advisory","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/citruscapital.ca\/advisory\/","title":{"rendered":"Advisory"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1585\" class=\"elementor elementor-1585\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ekjheoq elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"ekjheoq\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-25748b2d\" data-id=\"25748b2d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-253d822f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"253d822f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Advisory<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1dca66c4 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"1dca66c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4958511 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4958511\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-00c1b0f\" data-id=\"00c1b0f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9435a3c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9435a3c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><em>Your numbers tell a story. We help you read it and decide what to do next.<\/em><\/p>\n\n<h3>Beyond the numbers.<\/h3>\n<p>You&#8217;re not short on information. You&#8217;re short on someone who can help you figure out what it means for where your business is going. Our advisory clients are smart operators who want a thinking partner at the table. Someone with the financial depth to understand the numbers and the strategic perspective to know what to do with them.<\/p>\n\n<p>We&#8217;ve worked with businesses across virtually every industry and at every stage of growth. Our clients aren&#8217;t looking for a report. They&#8217;re looking for a direction.<\/p>\n\n<h3>Business Advisory<\/h3>\n<p>Strategy, growth, and operational clarity for businesses ready to move.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strategic planning and growth strategy<\/li>\n<li>Market expansion and opportunity evaluation<\/li>\n<li>Business development and client acquisition strategy<\/li>\n<li>Operational improvement and efficiency<\/li>\n<li>Organizational design and team structure<\/li>\n<li>OKRs and performance frameworks<\/li>\n<li>Acquisition, succession, and exit planning support<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<h3>Financial Advisory<\/h3>\n<p>Turning your financial picture into informed, confident decisions.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Financial budget development and execution<\/li>\n<li>Financial performance analysis and reporting<\/li>\n<li>KPI establishment and performance monitoring<\/li>\n<li>Banking, funding, and capital structure advisory<\/li>\n<li>Risk assessment and mitigation strategy<\/li>\n<li>Internal controls and accounting policy frameworks<\/li>\n<li>Finance team development and training<\/li>\n<li>Department-level financial review<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<h3>Data without direction is just noise.<\/h3>\n<p>Most business owners have more information than they know what to do with. Statements, dashboards, reports and still no clear answer on where to go next. That&#8217;s the gap we work in. We take what your business is telling you and help you decide what to do about it.<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Book a Consultation.<\/strong> Ready to make your numbers work harder? Let&#8217;s talk.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b81995 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"4b81995\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/citruscapital.ca\/contact-us\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Book a Meeting<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Strategic Advisory You\u2019re an experienced business leader with a diverse team, ready to pursue a new direction and unsure where specifically you want to go next. We will help you systematically evaluate your alternatives and step into clear, aligned action. We will work with you to prioritize your business objectives, develop and drive cross-functional strategy [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":7,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"page-builder","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"disabled","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"disabled","footer-sml-layout":"","ast-disable-related-posts":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"enabled","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-meta":"","astra-migrate-meta-layouts":"default","ast-page-background-enabled":"default","ast-page-background-meta":{"desktop":{"background-color":"","background-image":"","background-repeat":"repeat","background-position":"center center","background-size":"auto","background-attachment":"scroll","background-type":"","background-media":"","overlay-type":"","overlay-color":"","overlay-opacity":"","overlay-gradient":""},"tablet":{"background-color":"","background-image":"","background-repeat":"repeat","background-position":"center center","background-size":"auto","background-attachment":"scroll","background-type":"","bac